    "detailed_description": "Heroes of Dungeon-a Game based on the mechanics of &quot; 3 in a row&quot;<br />\r\nThe essence of the puzzle genre &quot;collect three&quot; is reduced to making groups, lines and rows of 3 or more identical chips.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHeroes of Dungeon - This is the case when a seemingly ordinary puzzle challenges the player and he understands that only on his attentiveness and reaction depends on the victory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are waiting for adventures in the dungeon, choose one of the three characters and go on the road. On the way you will meet a lot of enemies, ranging from skeletons to dragons. Everyone has different characteristics, so you need to act quickly by collecting combinations of 3 or more identical tiles,so you hit the enemy. As you progress your character becomes stronger and learns new magic spells: You can freeze the enemy, or blow up tiles to make a big combo and deal a lot of damage to the enemy!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures<br />\r\nFun and memorable graphics<br />\r\nEpic music<br />\r\nA wide variety of enemies",
